  dialogues:
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Pros: your internal teams time is free to review the programme, other
      logistics requirements for the project, and get the supply chain lined up for
      pricing the project which will increase the quality and timeliness of your
      client tender return. Your client satisfaction increases because they can see
      your attention to detail on these items. The specialist produces excellent
      quality scope of works for all packages and nearly 100% of potential scope
      gaps are captured. This could really set you up for an excellent construction
      phase...

'
  - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c8fcfa5882242b84b8bf1fb55659059e, type: 2}
    emotion: 0
    text: 'Cons: the specialist was very expensive, and carried out a significant
      amount of work.

'
